      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the sentences, using the words in the box. You may need to change the form of the words.</strong></p>\n<table style=\"border-collapse: collapse; width: 100%; height: 36px;\" border=\"1\">\n<tbody>\n<tr style=\"height: 36px;\">\n<td style=\"width: 24.5655%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\"><strong>immigrant</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5655%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\"><strong>introduce</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5655%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\"><strong>origin</strong></td>\n<td style=\"width: 24.5655%; text-align: center; height: 36px;\"><strong>praise</strong></td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n<p><br>1. The first thing you should learn in English is how to <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>10.1</label><input id='fbo-906821-0' class='ms fillblank-option-10' index='0' name='fbo-906821-0' type='text' size='11' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906821-0' /></span></strong> yourself.</p>\n<p>2. Many <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>10.2</label><input id='fbo-906821-1' class='ms fillblank-option-10' index='1' name='fbo-906821-1' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906821-1' /></span></strong> learn English to communicate better and find opportunities in new countries.</p>\n<p>3. The teacher always <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>10.3</label><input id='fbo-906821-2' class='ms fillblank-option-10' index='2' name='fbo-906821-2' type='text' size='8' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906821-2' /></span></strong> students who work hard to improve their English skills.</p>\n<p>4. People from different countries in this region may have different <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>10.4</label><input id='fbo-906821-3' class='ms fillblank-option-10' index='3' name='fbo-906821-3' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906821-3' /></span></strong>, but they can all speak English.</p>",
