      "questionText": "<p><strong>Complete the conversation, using the following words.</strong></p>\n<p><strong><img src=\"/images/exams/set_3_-_World_Englishes_d7e980fe.png\" alt width=\"500\"></strong></p>\n<p>Anna: Hi, John! I was absent from class yesterday. What did you do in the class?</p>\n<p>John: We started with a quick <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.1</label><input id='fbo-906805-0' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='0' name='fbo-906805-0' type='text' size='9' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906805-0' /></span></strong> of the last lesson. We went over some key points about English accents.</p>\n<p>Anna: Sounds useful! What happened next?</p>\n<p>John: Then we had a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.2</label><input id='fbo-906805-1' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='1' name='fbo-906805-1' type='text' size='15' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906805-1' /></span></strong>. Each group explained how English is spoken in a specific country in front of the class.</p>\n<p>Anna: That sounds interesting! Did the<strong> <span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.3</label><input id='fbo-906805-2' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='2' name='fbo-906805-2' type='text' size='13' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906805-2' /></span></strong> give any feedback?</p>\n<p>John: Yes, he gave some good advice. He mentioned we should focus more on examples of accents.</p>\n<p>Anna: I see. Was there any time for a <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>14.4</label><input id='fbo-906805-3' class='ms fillblank-option-14' index='3' name='fbo-906805-3' type='text' size='14' autocomplete='off' data-testid='fillblank-input-906805-3' /></span></strong> after that?</p>\n<p>John: Yes, we had a short one about how English changes in different regions. It was really interesting!</p>",
