      "questionType": "FillBlank",
      "questionText": "<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"309\"><strong>Read the following passage and choose the option that best fits each blank.</strong></p>\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\" data-start=\"0\" data-end=\"309\">Improving pronunciation in English is important for clear communication. To speak <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.1</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='0' name='fbo-906845-0' data-testid='fillblank-select-906845-0'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-906845-0'></option><option value=\"suddenly\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-0-suddenly'>suddenly</option><option value=\"quietly\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-0-quietly'>quietly</option><option value=\"effectively\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-0-effectively'>effectively</option><option value=\"carelessly\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-0-carelessly'>carelessly</option></select></span></strong>, it&#8217;s essential to practice the sounds and intonation of English. Some parts of English can be <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.2</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='1' name='fbo-906845-1' data-testid='fillblank-select-906845-1'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-906845-1'></option><option value=\"powerful\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-1-powerful'>powerful</option><option value=\"toxic\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-1-toxic'>toxic</option><option value=\"complicated\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-1-complicated'>complicated</option><option value=\"staple\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-1-staple'>staple</option></select></span></strong>, but with regular practice, it becomes easier to understand and use. One way to improve pronunciation is to focus on <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.3</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='2' name='fbo-906845-2' data-testid='fillblank-select-906845-2'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-906845-2'></option><option value=\"cheating\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-2-cheating'>cheating</option><option value=\"clarity\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-2-clarity'>clarity</option><option value=\"technology\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-2-technology'>technology</option><option value=\"peace\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-2-peace'>peace</option></select></span></strong> when speaking. This means pronouncing words clearly so others can understand you, especially when communicating with people from different backgrounds. To <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.4</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='3' name='fbo-906845-3' data-testid='fillblank-select-906845-3'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-906845-3'></option><option value=\"destroy\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-3-destroy'>destroy</option><option value=\"increase\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-3-increase'>increase</option><option value=\"attend\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-3-attend'>attend</option><option value=\"avoid\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-3-avoid'>avoid</option></select></span></strong> your fluency, listening to native speakers and repeating what they say can be very useful. I highly <strong><span class='fillblank-option'><label>15.5</label><select class='ms fillblank-option-15' index='4' name='fbo-906845-4' data-testid='fillblank-select-906845-4'><option value='' data-testid='fillblank-option-empty-906845-4'></option><option value=\"imagine\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-4-imagine'>imagine</option><option value=\"miss\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-4-miss'>miss</option><option value=\"recommend\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-4-recommend'>recommend</option><option value=\"regret\" data-testid='fillblank-option-906845-4-regret'>regret</option></select></span></strong>&nbsp;using apps or language groups to practice pronunciation regularly.</p>",
